{"unit_id":"RGarvel__dsh-channel-view#feature-1","repo":"RGarvel/dsh-channel-view","commit":"df2b6fa05acc201b8b62990a29dc4bf97e7d6c20","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-channel-view 的功能「按渠道分组」：在 Channels 标签页中将会话归入 QQ 私聊、QQ群聊、演示渠道、子代理或未观测分组。切换到 Channels 标签触发，输入会话列表和渠道状态，输出分组会话列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:71-87","lib/client.js:229-240"]}
